# Akawalli, the Seething Tower {1}{B}{G} (3/3): "Descend 4 - As long as there are four or more permanent cards in your graveyard,
# Akawalli gets +2/+2 and has trample. Descend 8 - As long as there are eight or more permanent cards in your graveyard, Akawalli gets
# an additional +2/+2 and can't be blocked by more than one creature" (CR 207.2c, 604.1, 613.4c). Thought Scour (an instant, never a
# permanent card) mills the top two of the library, set up so the permanent cards in Bot1's graveyard go: Black Lotus sacrificed (1),
# then two Ornithopters (3: still 3/3, no trample), an Ornithopter and a Shock (4: exactly four, 5/5 with trample), two Ornithopters
# (6), an Ornithopter and a Shock (7: still 5/5, no restriction), and on the next turn an Ornithopter and a Shock (8: exactly eight,
# 7/7 with trample and can't be blocked by more than one creature).

